s effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le08ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Understanding a Menu"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "It is important to understand a menu when you go to a restaurant. A menu has many items (types of dishes and drinks). Usually, the items are divided in different sections. <br> Many restaurants offer <span class=\"italic\">set lunches</span> or <span class=\"italic\">set dinners</span>, which are a number of items you can eat for a fixed price.<br> If you prefer to order what you like, you use the expression <span class=\"italic\">\u00c0 la carte</span>. <br> Look at the chart below for a list of items on a menu. Here you have some nouns related to food."}, {"type": "example", "content": " <span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: Let's have a look at the menu! <br> <span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: Yes! My goal is to try all the appetizers.<br> <span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: Ok. Let's share them. Leave room for dessert! "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Appetizers\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Main course\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Desserts\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Drinks\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">salad<br>nachos<br>onion rings<br>fries<br>soup</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">pizza<br>steak<br>fish<br>pasta<br>tacos</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">cake<br>ice cream<br>fruit salad</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">water<br>wine<br>beer<br>cocktails<br>coffee</span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to taste"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to sample; to eat or drink a small amount"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to taste many dishes!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob05aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you read a menu."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to try"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to have a little amount of food or drink"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are so many dishes I want to try!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob05aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "appetizer"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a dish at the beginning of a meal"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Let's order a few appetizers to start."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob05aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "main course"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the main part of the meal"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We have to keep some room for the main course!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob05aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cocktail"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a mixed drink, usually before the meal"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What do you call that cocktail again? A margarita?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob05aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "must-have"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an item you must try"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The fish tacos are a must-have here!  "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob05aud06"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go online. Visit the websites of 3 restaurants you know."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find 4 items from each restaurant."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Put the information in the chart below."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share your information with the class."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":5,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Appetizer\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Main Course\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Drinks\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Dessert\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"1\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"2\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"3\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text